WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.888
The young Ban Chao copied documents at a government office.

00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:12.576
Deep in the night, the lamp still burned; he wrote sheet after sheet, his eyes sore and tired.

00:00:12.576 --> 00:00:15.264
He set down his brush and sighed.

00:00:15.264 --> 00:00:21.600
The work was so hard and the pay so low — was he to copy documents his whole life?

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.440
Suddenly he stood up and threw his writing brush onto the desk!

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:30.384
I want to build great deeds like the heroes of old — this is 'throwing down the brush to join the army'!

00:00:30.384 --> 00:00:36.960
Ban Chao joined the army, put on armor, and trained with the soldiers, unafraid of any hardship.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.936
Later he led his party west, crossing the great desert, the caravan walking step by step toward the Western Regions.

00:00:42.936 --> 00:00:52.128
In the Western Regions, Ban Chao became a general and a diplomat, respected by the leaders of every state, winning great merit for Han.

